stream
BT /F2 16 Tf 54 723 Td (Return Material Authorisation \(RMA\) Process) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 701 Td (Document ID: sup-rma-process-v1 | Version: 1 | Effective: 2024-02-01 | Owner: Customer Support) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 688 Td (\(Rosa Delgado\)) Tj ET
BT /F2 13 Tf 54 663 Td (1. Scope) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 641 Td (This procedure describes how customers and partners return Halcyon, Tessera and Lumen products) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 628 Td (to Meridian Instruments for repair, warranty replacement or evaluation. No product may be) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 615 Td (returned without a valid Return Material Authorisation \(RMA\) number. Shipments that arrive) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 602 Td (without an RMA number are refused at goods-in.) Tj ET
BT /F2 13 Tf 54 577 Td (2. Requesting an RMA) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 555 Td (1. Send an email to rma@meridian-instruments.com with the subject line "RMA request" and the) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 542 Td (   product serial number.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 529 Td (2. Include the model \(for example HX-210 or TS4E-NODE-3AX\), the fault description, any error) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 516 Td (   code shown \(for example E-117 or L-215\), the purchase order or invoice number, and the) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 503 Td (   return shipping address.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 490 Td (3. The RMA desk replies within 2 business days with an RMA number in the format RMA-24-NNNNN,) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 477 Td (   for example RMA-24-00731, together with the shipping label and returns address.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 464 Td (4. One RMA number covers up to 10 units of the same model with the same fault. Mixed returns) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 451 Td (   need a separate RMA number per model.) Tj ET
BT /F2 13 Tf 54 435 Td (3. Validity) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 413 Td (An RMA number is valid for 30 days from issue. Units received after 30 days are held for 10) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 400 Td (business days while the RMA desk contacts the customer, and are then returned unrepaired at the) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 387 Td (customer's cost if no new RMA is requested.) Tj ET
BT /F2 13 Tf 54 362 Td (4. Returns addresses) Tj ET
BT /F2 9 Tf 54 341 Td (Customer region | Returns location) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 54 329 Td (UK, Europe, Middle East and Africa \(EMEA\) | Meridian Instruments Ltd, Service Centre, Leeds,) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 54 317 Td (United Kingdom) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 54 305 Td (North, Central and South America | Meridian Instruments Inc., Service Centre, Austin, Texas,) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 54 293 Td (United States) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 54 281 Td (Asia-Pacific | Meridian Instruments Sdn Bhd, Service Centre, Penang, Malaysia) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 259 Td (Write the RMA number clearly on the outside of every carton. Pack gas detectors with their) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 246 Td (battery installed but switched off. Lumen flow meters must be drained, dried and shipped with) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 233 Td (flange protection covers fitted.) Tj ET
BT /F2 13 Tf 54 208 Td (5. Decontamination) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 186 Td (Meridian strongly recommends that a completed decontamination declaration accompanies every) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 173 Td (return of a product that has been in contact with process fluids, hazardous gases or) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 160 Td (contaminated environments. Service engineers may delay inspection of products without a) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 147 Td (declaration until the customer confirms in writing that the product is safe to handle.) Tj ET
BT /F2 13 Tf 54 122 Td (6. Advance replacement) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 100 Td (Advance replacement is available to Premier support customers only. On approval, a replacement) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 87 Td (unit is dispatched from regional stock before the faulty unit is received. The faulty unit must) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 74 Td (then be returned within 30 days, or the replacement unit is invoiced at list price.) Tj ET
endstream
