BT /F2 13 Tf 54 726 Td (7. Assessment and turnaround) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 704 Td (On receipt, the service centre inspects the unit and classifies the return as:) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 682 Td (- Warranty repair or replacement at no charge.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 669 Td (- Chargeable repair, for which a quotation is sent and must be approved within 15 business) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 656 Td (   days.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 643 Td (- No fault found, which carries an inspection fee of GBP 95 \(or local equivalent\) for units) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 630 Td (   outside warranty.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 617 Td (The target turnaround is 15 business days from receipt to dispatch for warranty repairs and) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 604 Td (from quotation approval for chargeable repairs. Calibrated instruments \(Halcyon\) are returned) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 591 Td (with a fresh calibration certificate.) Tj ET
BT /F2 13 Tf 54 566 Td (8. Shipping costs) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 544 Td (For warranty returns, Meridian pays the inbound shipping using the label supplied with the RMA) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 531 Td (and the outbound shipping. For chargeable repairs, the customer pays inbound shipping and) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 518 Td (outbound shipping is added to the repair quotation.) Tj ET
BT /F2 13 Tf 54 493 Td (9. Contact) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 471 Td (Questions about an open RMA should be sent to rma@meridian-instruments.com quoting the RMA) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 458 Td (number.) Tj ET
endstream
